%% Main workflow overview — designed for Mermaid-to-Excalidraw conversion.
%% Detailed shared-tool wiring is in agent-tool-resume.mmd.
flowchart LR
    start([START]) --> init[Initialize user data]
    init --> input[Collect user request]
    input --> intent{Understand request}

    intent -->|Chat| input
    intent -->|End| finish([END])
    intent -->|Find JobRight jobs| jobright[Fetch JobRight jobs]
    jobright -->|More jobs or tools needed| jobright
    jobright -->|Finished| input

    intent -->|Single job URL| details[Extract job details]
    details --> save[Save job to workbook]

    intent -->|Apply to saved jobs| queue[Build application queue]
    queue --> dispatch[Choose next queued job]
    dispatch -->|Job available| validate_context[Build validation context]
    dispatch -->|Queue empty| input

    save --> validate_context

    subgraph application[Application flow for the current job]
        direction LR
        validate_context --> validate{Validate job}
        validate -->|Not eligible| status[Update job status]
        validate -->|Eligible| resolve{Resolve application URL}

        resolve -->|URL ready| apply{Submit application}
        resolve -->|Login needed| login{Perform login}
        resolve -->|Cannot resolve| review[Human review]

        login -->|Login succeeds| resolve
        login -->|Login fails| review

        apply -->|Applied| verify_context[Build verification context]
        verify_context --> verify{Verify application}
        verify -->|Confirmed or not confirmed| status
        apply -->|Not applied| status
        apply -->|Needs human help| review

        review -->|Resume URL resolution| resolve
        review -->|Resume login| login
        review -->|Resume application| apply
    end

    status -->|More queued jobs| dispatch
    status -->|No queued jobs| input

    tool_note["Tool calls are shown separately in agent-tool-resume.mmd"]
